Q: How to handle multiple files in react and display a list of files to be uploaded A: <p>You have to add them like this:</p>
<pre><code>const [images, setImages] = useState();

if (e.target.files[0]) {
  const target = e.target;
  setImages((prevValue) =&gt; ({
